#
# golden.core — the models from build_system/golden.models that go on each
# architecture's core disc (zxv-<arch>-disc1-core.img, in /ZXV/MODELS on its
# EFI System Partition), one name per line. The others go on the swarm discs
# (build_system/golden.swarm); every model is on exactly one disc.
#
# Keep the core small: it is what firmware reads, and the arm64 loader
# hashes these models on every boot before it starts the kernel. One model
# that can answer on its own is enough to start with; the swarm discs follow
# once the kernel's storage drivers are up.

# 491 MB, Apache-2.0: the smallest model that answers on its own.
qwen2.5-0.5b-instruct-q4_k_m.gguf
